# Bot1 has Rest in Peace out on turn 1. On turn 3 Faithless Looting makes Bot1 discard Basking Rootwalla and a Mountain.
# Bot1 orders madness first (CR 616.1): the Rootwalla is discarded into exile and its madness ability triggers - it is on
# the stack at the next priority (CR 702.35a). Bot1 declines to cast it, so the trigger puts it into its owner's
# graveyard; Rest in Peace replaces that move in turn and the card ends in exile, as it would have with Rest in Peace
# first. The Island is Bot2's turn-2 discard to hand size.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Rest in Peace
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Basking Rootwalla
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rest in Peace.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Basking Rootwalla; Mountain)
Bot1.Replace(madness)
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Decline

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Mox Pearl; Mountain; Rest in Peace
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Exile = Faithless Looting; Island; Mountain; Basking Rootwalla
